INTERFACE zif_osd_rap_registry PUBLIC.
* The behavior definitions of the tree, generated by tools/rap/bdef-gen.mjs
* as ZCL_OSD_RAP_REGISTRY in gen/rap/ (docs/rap-runtime.md). The runtime
* creates that class by name, so a tree without any behavior definition
* still compiles: there is simply no registry to find.

  TYPES tt_name TYPE STANDARD TABLE OF string WITH DEFAULT KEY.

* the adapter of one behavior definition, or an initial reference
  METHODS get
    IMPORTING
      iv_bdef      TYPE csequence
    RETURNING
      VALUE(ro_bo) TYPE REF TO zif_osd_rap_bo.

* every behavior definition with an adapter, sorted
  METHODS list
    RETURNING
      VALUE(rt_bdef) TYPE tt_name.

ENDINTERFACE.
